1. PURPOSE

This License governs access to and use of the RXI-Lab repository and
the materials contained within it.

RXI-Lab is a proprietary curriculum research, design, engineering,
and development project associated with Artslink Study Abroad Services
Company ("Artslink").

The project includes contributions relating to curriculum architecture,
academic knowledge modeling, research and innovation education,
instructional design, computational curriculum engineering,
Human-AI collaborative methods, software, structured data,
documentation, and related research and development artifacts.


2. PROPRIETARY STATUS

This repository and its contents are proprietary.

